{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124090000809-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124094340\"/><p>涉事兩Tesla電動車。</p><p>青馬大橋發生交通意外。今日(24日)早上8時29分，兩輛Tesla電動車與一輛的士沿路往機場方向行駛，期間3車首尾相撞，的士車頭損毀嚴重。事件中據報有人受傷，人員正調查意外原因。受事件影響，往機場方向交通一度受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:55:06.078344+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:17:26.324881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:48:19.624812+00:00","content_hash":"1fff97c5045a939acf313ae5ff2dd7aa41535b69c774019721d54396b92065e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}